.1080/09397140.2015.1132556" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-signal-blue hover:underline">10.1080/09397140.2015.1132556</a></dgdoi:pub-id></span><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=Amr%20ZS%2C%20Robb%20MS%2C%20Nunes%20JMG%2C%20Baker%20MAA%20%26amp%3B%20Walsh%20A%202016b%3A%20Diet%20of%20the%20Omani%20owl%2C%20Strix%20butleri%2C%20near%20Nakhal%2C%20Oman.%20Zoology%20in%20the%20Middle%20East%2062%3A%2017%E2%80%9320.10.1080%2F09397140.2015.1132556" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-signal-blue text-button-sm text-white h-6 px-3 flex justify-center items-center rounded-full hover:bg-signal-blue-hover cursor-pointer">Search in Google Scholar</a><a href="?tab=article#inline-text-j_srj-2018-0003_ref_003_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab3Aa" class="text-signal-blue text-button-sm hover:outline-1 px-2 flex items-center rounded-full gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-undo2 lucide-undo-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 14 4 9l5-5"></path><path d="M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.5 5.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5H11"></path></svg><span>Back to article</span></a></div></li><li id="j_srj-2018-0003_ref_004_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab4Aa" class="text-body-m text-neutral-20"><span>Amr ZS, Abu Baker MA, Qumsiyeh M &amp; Eid E 2018: Systematics, Distribution and ecological analysis of rodents in Jordan. Zootaxa 4397: 1–94.<dgdoi:pub-id xmlns:dgdoi="http://degruyter.com/resources/doi-from-crossref" pub-id-type="doi"><a href="https://doi.org/10.11646/zootaxa.4397.1.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-signal-blue hover:underline">10.11646/zootaxa.4397.1.1</a></dgdoi:pub-id><dgpm:pub-id xmlns:dgpm="http://degruyter.com/resources/fetched-pubmed-id" pub-id-type="pmid">29690341</dgpm:pub-id></span><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a hre