MAA \u0026amp; Walsh A 2016b: Diet of the Omani owl, \u003citalic\u003eStrix butleri\u003c/italic\u003e, near Nakhal, Oman. Zoology in the Middle East 62: 17–20.\u003cdgdoi:pub-id xmlns:dgdoi=\\\"http://degruyter.com/resources/doi-from-crossref\\\" pub-id-type=\\\"doi\\\"\u003e10.1080/09397140.2015.1132556\u003c/dgdoi:pub-id\u003e\u003c/mixed-citation\u003e\u003c/ref\u003e\"},{\"refId\":\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_004_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab4Aa\",\"citeString\":\"Amr ZS, Abu Baker MA, Qumsiyeh M \u0026amp; Eid E 2018: Systematics, Distribution and ecological analysis of rodents in Jordan. Zootaxa 4397: 1–94.\u003cdgdoi:pub-id xmlns:dgdoi=\\\"http://degruyter.com/resources/doi-from-crossref\\\" pub-id-type=\\\"doi\\\"\u003e10.11646/zootaxa.4397.1.1\u003c/dgdoi:pub-id\u003e\u003cdgpm:pub-id xmlns:dgpm=\\\"http://degruyter.com/resources/fetched-pubmed-id\\\" pub-id-type=\\\"pmid\\\"\u003e29690341\u003c/dgpm:pub-id\u003e\",\"doi\":null,\"mixedCitation\":\"\u003cref id=\\\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_004_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab4Aa\\\"\u003e\u003cmixed-citation\u003eAmr ZS, Abu Baker MA, Qumsiyeh M \u0026amp; Eid E 2018: Systematics, Distribution and ecological analysis of rodents in Jordan. Zootaxa 4397: 1–94.\u003cdgdoi:pub-id xmlns:dgdoi=\\\"http://degruyter.com/resources/doi-from-crossref\\\" pub-id-type=\\\"doi\\\"\u003e10.11646/zootaxa.4397.1.1\u003c/dgdoi:pub-id\u003e\u003cdgpm:pub-id xmlns:dgpm=\\\"http://degruyter.com/resources/fetched-pubmed-id\\\" pub-id-type=\\\"pmid\\\"\u003e29690341\u003c/dgpm:pub-id\u003e\u003c/mixed-citation\u003e\u003c/ref\u003e\"},{\"refId\":\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_005_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab5Aa\",\"citeString\":\"Andrews IJ 1995: The birds of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan. Burns \u0026amp; Harris Limited, Dundec, Scotland.\",\"doi\":null,\"mixedCitation\":\"\u003cref id=\\\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_005_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab5Aa\\\"\u003e\u003cmixed-citation\u003eAndrews IJ 1995: The birds of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan. Burns \u0026amp; Harris Limited, Dundec, Scotland.\u003c/mixed-citation\u003e\u003c/ref\u003e\"},{\"refId\":\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_006_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab6Aa\",\"citeString\":\"Aulagnier S, Haffner P, Mitchell-Jones AJ, Moutou F \u0026amp; Zima J 2009: Mammals of Europe, North Africa and the Middle East. A \u0026amp; C Black Publishers, London.\",\"doi\":null,\"mixedCitation\":\"\u003cref id=\\\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_006_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab6Aa\\\"\u003e\u003cmixed-citation\u003eAulagnier S, Haffner P, Mitchell-Jones AJ, Moutou F \u0026amp; Zima J 2009: Mammals of Europe, North Africa and the Middle East. A \u0026amp; C Black Publishers, London.\u003c/mixed-citation\u003e\u003c/ref\u003e\"},{\"refId\":\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_007_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab7Aa\",\"citeString\":\"Baker MAA, Qarqaz M \u0026amp; Amr ZS 2005: Diet of the barn owl (\u003citalic\u003eTyto alba\u003c/italic\u003e) in Shaumari Wildlife Reserve, Eastern Jordan. Jornal by the National Museum, Natural History Series 174, 1–4: 125–127.\",\"doi\":null,\"mixedCitation\":\"\u003cref id=\\\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_007_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab7Aa\\\"\u003e\u003cmixed-citation\u003eBaker MAA, Qarqaz M \u0026amp; Amr ZS 2005: Diet of the barn owl (\u003citalic\u003eTyto alba\u003c/italic\u003e) in Shaumari Wildlife Reserve, Eastern Jordan. Jornal by the National Museum, Natural History Series 174, 1–4: 125–127.\u003c/mixed-citation\u003e\u003c/ref\u003e\"},{\"refId\":\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_008_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab8Aa\",\"citeString\":\"Benda P, Andreas M, Kock D, Lučan R, Munclinger P, Nová P, Obuch J, Ochman K, Reiter A, Uhrin M \u0026amp; Weinfurtová D 2006: Bats (Mammalia: Chiroptera) of the Eastern Mediterranean. Part 4. Bat fauna of Syria: distribution, systematics, ecology. Acta Soc. Zool. Bohem. 70: 1–329.\",\"doi\":null,\"mixedCitation\":\"\u003cref id=\\\"j_srj-2018-0003_ref_008_w2aab3b7b3b1b6b1ab1ab8Aa\\\"\u003e\u003cmixed-citation\u003eBenda P, Andreas M, Kock D, Lučan R, Munclinger P, Nová P, Obuch J, Ochman K, Reiter A, Uhrin M \u0026amp; We